==============================================================================
THE MOMENT-LP HIERARCHY: fixing more moments S_0..S_{L-1} tightens the bound
==============================================================================
 This IS the Bonferroni / CJJ Mobius hierarchy: level uses moments up to order L.
 level-1(Delsarte)=R+1 moments; the FULL level (L=7) pins p_0=measS7 exactly.
 We tabulate the bound at each L and whether CONSEC stays the argmax at each L.

--- k=8 (level-1 fixes 5 moments; full = 7 moments = exact measS7) ---
   L=5 moments (level-1(Delsarte) ): consec bound=0.358231  #beating consec=0  consec-max? True  (global max=0.358231)
